id: flash-bang
name: Flash Bang
kind: gear
tags: tech
craftDC: Qualified
# "Spend 1 Action to target a Square."
placeCost: 1
# "Make a Clash (Impulsive) against all Characters within a Sphere AoE of your targeted
# Square. If you win, they gain the Blinded Combat Condition until the start of your next
# turn."
clashSave: impulsive
clashCondition: blinded
clashUntil: start
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Thrown to blind everyone around where it lands. Win a Clash (Impulsive) and they are
  Blinded until the start of your next turn.
text: >
  Flash Bang [Tech]: A thrown weapon that blinds and deafens targets.
  –Craft DC: Qualified
  –Effects: Spend 1 Action to target a Square within a Destructive Sphere AoE (centered on
  yourself). Make a Clash (Impulsive) against all Characters within a Sphere AoE of your
  targeted Square. If you win, they gain the Blinded Combat Condition until the start of
  your next turn.

---

# --- What the system does ---------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Throwing it spends the Action and opens a Saving Throw Clash, Impulsive on both sides, with
# every character the player has targeted - one Clash each, since each of them answers for
# themselves. Won, that one is Blinded, and the clock is the thrower's: "until the start of
# YOUR next turn".
#
# --- What the table keeps ----------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Which Square, and who the Sphere around it catches. There are no Squares here, so the ones
# it catches are the ones targeted when it is thrown.
#
# "Blinds and deafens" is the flavour line; the effect names only Blinded, and only Blinded
# is given. Whether it is used up the entry does not say, and it stays on the character.
